# SQ-0002 retains source, locks, and concise evidence, not downloaded runtimes
# or build/package caches. Probe commands place reusable caches under /tmp.
**/.lake/
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.pyc
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/wheelhouse/
**/*.Rcheck/
**/.Rproj.user/
**/.julia/
**/compiled/
**/artifacts/
**/scratchspaces/
